# === GitHub Pages example — local config, DO NOT COMMIT with your values ===
# Usage:
#   cp deploy-examples/github.example .deploy.local   (then fill in USER/REPO below)
#   npm run package                                    (backup ZIP)
#
# Note: GitHub Pages deploys by pushing to `main`
# (workflow .github/workflows/hugo.yml). The ZIP is only an archive:
# use `git push`, no ZIP upload. IP counter possible ONLY
# via the single backend (HUGO_VISIT_API_URL to the Worker+D1, see IPS.md);
# without it, no measurement (silent).

# Target platform (do not change in this file)
TARGET=github

# Public URL — REQUIRED, with the repo subpath:
# https://USER.github.io/REPO/
SITE_URL=https://USER.github.io/REPO/

# --- Single visits/IP backend (optional, see IPS.md) ---
# HUGO_VISIT_API_URL=https://mon-licenciement-visits.<account>.workers.dev/api/visit

# --- SEO: verification + IndexNow (optional, see DEPLOY.md SEO section) ---
# HUGO_GOOGLE_SITE_VERIFICATION=
# HUGO_BING_SITE_VERIFICATION=
# INDEXNOW_KEY= (generate via npm run seo:init)

# --- Giscus comments (optional, see COMMENTAIRES.md) ---
# Uncomment and fill in the 4 values copied from https://giscus.app
# GISCUS_REPO=USER/REPO-commentaires
# GISCUS_REPO_ID=R_xxx
# GISCUS_CATEGORY=Announcements
# GISCUS_CATEGORY_ID=DIC_xxx
